# VTID-03982 — commands run during this change

## Identifying the two accounts (read-only, Supabase MCP, project inmkhvwdcuyhnxkgfvsb)

$ select id, email, raw_app_meta_data->>'exafy_admin' as exafy_admin, created_at
  from auth.users where email ilike '%claude-code-agent%' or email ilike '%operator-autopilot%'
  order by created_at;
→ claude-code-agent@exafy.io   = 887b34cb-9ee9-47dc-ad53-db5be1869846 (created 2026-09-16 11:38:38 UTC)
  operator-autopilot@exafy.io  = 856c30ed-7136-4bc5-8bfe-86a1e8ea1401 (created 2026-09-16 11:38:40 UTC)

$ select case when sender_id in (<the two ids>) then sender_id else receiver_id end as dev_account,
    count(*), count(distinct case when sender_id in (<the two ids>) then receiver_id else sender_id end),
    min(created_at), max(created_at)
  from chat_messages
  where sender_id in (<the two ids>) or receiver_id in (<the two ids>)
  group by 1;
→ operator-autopilot:  223 messages, 223 distinct counterparts, all at 2026-09-16 11:38:40.74971 UTC
  claude-code-agent:   222 messages, 222 distinct counterparts, all at 2026-09-16 11:38:38.525781 UTC
  (single bulk insert per account at account-creation time — a "Hello! My name is ..." intro DM
   fanned out to every community member)

